Magister_CIV4GameText_FFH2.xml	TXT_KEY_LEADER_FURIA_PEDIA	Furia is the schizophrenic, psychotic, suicidal queen of the Balseraphs. Though Perpentach never married Furia he called the extremely disturbed girl his queen for years. She has long been suicidal but Perpentach prevented her attempts by moving her mind into a new body each time she killed herself, which only added to her insanity (but amused him greatly). She would become irate when seeing her reflection because it wasn't one she recognized (having been body swapped by Perpentach) and it changed so frequently. [PARAGRAPH][TAB]"Furia our beautiful queen[PARAGRAPH][TAB]The most lovely I've ever seen[PARAGRAPH][TAB]but mad as. . . well me[PARAGRAPH][TAB]And never happy to see[PARAGRAPH][TAB]Her reflection, which makes her quite mean"[PARAGRAPH][TAB][TAB][TAB]- Perpentach	
